WEBVTT

00:04:58.829 --> 00:05:03.829
It’s 2013, and the United Nations
Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change

00:05:03.829 --> 00:05:06.788
has found, 
aggregating decades of research,

00:05:06.788 --> 00:05:10.579
that there is more than a 95% chance 
the global warming trend

00:05:10.579 --> 00:05:14.246
since the mid-20th century 
has been driven by human activity,

00:05:14.621 --> 00:05:17.079
namely the burning of fossil fuels.

00:05:18.079 --> 00:05:19.663
You’re both pets,

00:05:19.663 --> 00:05:23.871
and he likes living in water,
so you should, too.